This repository holds the built static site for musehub.live. The source lives in the
MuseHub monorepo. The bundle includes these third-party runtime components, each used
under its own terms:

- react, react-dom (MIT)
- @tanstack/react-router (MIT)
- @tanstack/react-query (MIT)

Web fonts are loaded at runtime from the Google Fonts CDN, not redistributed here:

- Bricolage Grotesque (SIL Open Font License 1.1)
- JetBrains Mono (SIL Open Font License 1.1)
- Instrument Sans (SIL Open Font License 1.1, expected)

Linking a CDN-hosted font is use, not redistribution, so the OFL notice duty does not
attach to this repository. See the monorepo DATA-SOURCES.md for the full analysis.
